For what it's worth, I 1st ascended with a Wizard.  Once you learn to cope
with food and avoiding some fights, Wizard is pretty cool (all these neat
spells!).  And if you're nuts (like I was), you can hack things to death
with a +2 Magicbane all the way to Astral :) Not *exactly* a Combat
Wombat, but I had fun.  Starting Magic Resistance is really handy, too.

Anyway, I'm not saying Wizard is easy or anything, just that it's not a
*bad* 1st choice.  Tourist, OTOH, is really hard (may be easier if you
don't get bad habits playing a W).

